ctangle's edges if the following conditions are satisfied:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-1\\le x\\le 5,\\,1\\le y\\le 3.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nMoreover, since *every* real value in these intervals is included, $x\\in R,y\\in R,$ and therefore \n\n$$\n(x,y)\\in R\\times R={R}^{2}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we can write our set as follows:\n\n$$\n{(x,y)\\in {R}^{2}\\,:\\,-1\\le x\\le 5,\\,1\\le y\\le 3}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186287718 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "52a2bbd7-a6e1-512f-8e42-247dc4da388a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value ">" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186285548} {:answer/id #uuid "8aa014b7-a71a-558d-ab99-b6abbcdfbad4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\le " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186286056} {:answer/id #uuid "8e4e591f-ffee-54cc-8e00-7eaf2bba5c79" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\ge " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186286087} {:answer/id #uuid "8ecd1167-2e19-522a-bb91-b5fcd306e681" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\ne " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186286092} {:answer/id #uuid "9b6ba0ed-adab-5157-8a75-e6a42f4c71f8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "<" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186286212}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186286212} :answer-field/id #uuid "7d09344a-24f4-55dc-90bb-ce9789a368c2" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045494 :db/ident :answer-field.type/select} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186287410} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2523bd39-79c7-5b4f-a228-06b7b3629049" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\ge " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186285114} {:answer/id #uuid "59fdf3f6-95ac-529f-af95-b6f0362a84cb" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math