answer/id #uuid "b0bdf1e2-8617-57df-9b92-170f23cd42f3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "<" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186286403} {:answer/id #uuid "b0ce0d2b-b6ce-560e-b8db-139ada8bc69d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value ">" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186286404} {:answer/id #uuid "f6db4d25-8682-565f-bf0b-ab16e59c367f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\le " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186287049}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186287049} :answer-field/id #uuid "e160ab85-733f-566f-ab05-297bedced861" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045494 :db/ident :answer-field.type/select} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186287608}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "44f795bd-05e4-56c1-a78c-5dcc5d6493ae" :question/math-academy-id "q-181682" :question/problem "![](images/b1/b1d71eb496878cedda9defd9932e3bc42ecb2772ad06e298e06881d1fb51f184.png)\n\nDescribe the shaded region shown above using set-builder notation.\n\n$$\n{(x,y)\\in {{field-1}}\\,:\\,-2\\,{{field-2}}\\,y\\,{{field-3}}\\,\\frac{1}{2}x+2}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "The points in our set include all those that lie *above* the line $y=-2$ and *below* the line $y=\\frac{1}{2}x+2.$\n\nA point $P(x,y)$ lies *inside* the shaded region if the following conditions are satisfied:\n\n$$\ny>-2,\\,y<\\frac{1}{2}x+2.\n$$\n\nCombining this into a single condition, we have\n\n$$\n-2<y<\\frac{1}{2}x+2.\n$$\n\nWe must also include the lines $y=-2$ and $y=\\frac{1}{2}x+2$ since the boundaries are included in the set (the lines are solid). So, we change the corresponding inequality symbols above as follows:\n\n$$\n-2\\le y\\le \\frac{1}{2}x+2\n$$\n\nMoreover, since we're considering *every* real value in this region, $x\\in R,y\\in R,$ and therefore \n\n$$\n(x,y)\\in R\\times R={R}^{2}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we can write the set as\n\n$$\n{(x,y)\\in {R}^{2}\\,:\\,-2\\le y\\le \\frac{1}{2}x+2}.\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186287720 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "137b58ec-5689-5323-91cd-860ba199e6b6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value ">" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186284961} {:answer/id #uuid "1a041384-7ae2-50dd-b535-eab96fc15099" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\le " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186285019} {:answer/id #uuid "49fb7ece-48fb-5ed0-9d14-56adb60f5178" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "<" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186285472} {:answer/id #uuid "4babd855-e7eb-5c9d-add4-37f62dd272a3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\ne " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186285493} {:answer/id #uuid "c5145152-0a3b-5323-8789-73a4fff67c3f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\ge " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186286593}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186285472} :answer-field/id #uuid "426c3ca2-db0c-5b82-be2c-84f537fa5137" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045494 :db/ident :answer-field.type/select} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186287291} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0a6f37ed-2fe3-5381-a17e-8b5ac643f527" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\ge " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186284874} {:answer/id #uuid "16326a2e-f484-512f-afa3-d735e4d76507" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\ne " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186284988} {:answer/id #uuid "280eaccf-fa58-5325-a4c0-a03c5bd619c3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value ">" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186285137} {:answer/id #uuid "647a2212-728b-5ead-b