lem "![](images/09/09df7202fbe0c9160e6c10dc10a813bc6b4b00aae7d95a01068dd4154fb5d929.png)\n\nDescribe the shaded region shown above using set-builder notation.\n\n$$\n{(x,y)\\in {{field-1}}\\,:\\,-2\\,{{field-2}}\\,y\\,{{field-3}}\\,x}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "The points in our set include all those that lie *above* the line $y=-2$ and *below* the line $y=x.$\n\nA point $P(x,y)$ lies *inside* the shaded region if the following conditions are satisfied:\n\n$$\ny>-2,\\,y<x.\n$$\n\n \n\nCombining this into a single condition, we have\n\n$$\n-2<y<x\n$$\n\nSince the boundary is not included in the set (the lines are dashed), the inequalities are strict.\n\nMoreover, since we're considering *every* real value in this region, $x\\in R,y\\in R,$ and therefore \n\n$$\n(x,y)\\in R\\times R={R}^{2}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we can write the set as\n\n$$\n{(x,y)\\in {R}^{2}\\,:\\,-2<y<x}.\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186287721 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5aac82fc-0378-5fa3-8f35-d27dbd288067" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "R" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186285616} {:answer/id #uuid "8cc70e62-ae88-5eba-846c-1494ae1b9c8d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "N" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186286076} {:answer/id #uuid "bb5b87b5-bb69-5e1b-a371-88192b893963" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{C}^{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186286493} {:answer/id #uuid "bc2a01bb-63a9-5243-aa7c-139acd83c668" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186286501} {:answer/id #uuid "fdcf5411-46c3-5497-9c65-427d4d4412ab" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{R}^{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186287107}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186287107} :answer-field/id #uuid "19f0007a-2cb0-5e2a-bc0c-8