aded region if the following conditions are satisfied:\n\n$$\ny<4,\\,y<4x+1.\n$$\n\nWe must also include the lines $y=4$ and $y=4x+1$ since the boundaries are included in the set (the lines are solid). So, we change the corresponding inequality symbols above as follows:\n\n$$\ny\\le 4,\\,y\\le 4x+1\n$$\n\nMoreover, since we're considering *every* real value in this region, $x\\in R,y\\in R,$ and therefore \n\n$$\n(x,y)\\in R\\times R={R}^{2}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we can write the set as\n\n$$\n\\{(x,y)\\in {R}^{2}\\,:\\,y\\le 4,\\,y\\le 4x+1\\}.\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186287723 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1563cb94-a78b-59ab-b968-b7915dec5fc4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\le " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186284976} {:answer/id #uuid "2c068051-c8d3-5ebe-a875-f10cb6cd1f9c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\ne " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186285171} {:answer/id #uuid "6e993495-ec10-5795-8246-adef9fd366da" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "<" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186285808} {:answer/id #uuid "a0add778-b828-54ce-a9fd-b32d3fc42d16" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value ">" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186286253} {:answer/id #uuid "e0a96dbc-4105-5807-987a-a62f69ee05a8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\ge " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186286833}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186285808} :answer-field/id #uuid "2030dc95-30dd-5375-9978-3f149bbbdcb2" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045494 :db/ident :answer-field.type/select} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186287217} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5432b52c-70f5-5dcf-89da-b06c16ba5cc3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\ge " :d